SNAPVERE v0.1.0 CI-signed release trigger

This trigger publishes the already validated 0.1.0 Windows + Android source without requiring a private Android production keystore.

Android public APK contract:
- build and test debug + release variants
- publish the verified CI/debug-signed debug APK as SNAPVERE.apk
- verify APK signature and ZIP alignment
- publish SNAPVERE-Android-Source.zip from the validated Git tree

Windows public contract remains:
- SNAPVERE-Setup.exe
- SNAPVERE-Portable.exe
- x86/x64/ARM64 embedded payloads
- x64/x86 lifecycle and tray-first validation

The release must contain exactly four public assets and verify their SHA-256 digests after publication.
